------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Samples (samples/*) are synthetic demo data describing a fictional battery
("OpenDPP Demo Manufacturing — NOT A REAL COMPANY"), fetched verbatim from the
live demo service. They contain no real personal data and no private keys: the
did:web document holds only the public verification key, and the base58/JWT
proof values are signatures over public demo data, not secrets.
